WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:03.750
(VOICEOVER) Who are you?

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:08.550
I have many names. My
people call me Kukulkan,

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.440
but my enemies call me Namor.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.460
What is that?

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.460
The feather serpent god.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.560
NAMOR: I brought the
sun to my people,

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.840
but now you see what
I have to protect.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.200
NAMOR: (VOICEOVER) I became
the firstborn son of Talokan.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.670
I could swim the sky.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:31.155
Breathe the air our
ancestors breathe

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.305
Only the most broken people
can be great leaders.

00:00:38.578 --> 00:00:40.566
[GRUNTS]

00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:44.045
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:48.021 --> 00:00:50.510
[THUD]

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:52.160
I heard you that night.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:54.350
You said you wanted
to burn the world.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:57.270
Let us burn it together.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:01.650
[SHOUTING] Talokanile'ex!

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.340
Liik'ik Talokan!

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:04.240
CROWD: Liik'ik Talokan!

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:10.590
[MUSIC PLAYING]

